{"name":"Washed Black","hex":"#1f262a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"washed","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of wash"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Ellipsis of washed up."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/washed"},{"term":"black","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Absorbing all light and reflecting none; dark and hueless.","Without light."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The colour/color perceived in the absence of light, but also when no light is reflected, but rather absorbed.","A black dye or pigment."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/black"}],"entries":[{"title":"Washed","blocks":[{"text":"\"Washed\" is a song recorded live by the American Christian music collective Elevation Rhythm. The song was released on September 19, 2025, through Elevation Worship Records, to digital download and streaming formats. It was written by Joe L. Barnes, Joshua Holiday, Mitch Wong, and Steven Furtick, while Holiday produced. \"Washed\" peaked at number 97 on the Billboard Hot 100 and number 1 on the Hot Christian Songs chart."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/6/6c/Elevation_Rhythm_Washed.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washed"},{"title":"Black","blocks":[{"text":"Black is a color that results from the absence or complete absorption of visible light. It is an achromatic color, without chroma, like white and grey. It is often used symbolically or figuratively to represent darkness. Black and white have often been used to describe opposites such as good and evil, the Dark Ages versus the Age of Enlightenment, and night versus day. Since the Middle Ages, black has been the symbolic color of solemnity and authority, and for this reason it is still commonly worn by judges and magistrates."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Tutankhamun_jackal_%28blacked%29.png/330px-Tutankhamun_jackal_%28blacked%29.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Yellowstone-black-bear-07895.jpg/500px-Yellowstone-black-bear-07895.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Yellowstone-black-bear-07895.jpg/500px-Yellowstone-black-bear-07895.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AYellowstone-black-bear-07895.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Queen_Victoria_after_Heinrich_von_Angeli.jpg/500px-Queen_Victoria_after_Heinrich_von_Angeli.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Queen_Victoria_after_Heinrich_von_Angeli.jpg/500px-Queen_Victoria_after_Heinrich_von_Angeli.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AQueen_Victoria_by_Heinrich_von_Angeli.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Milky_Way_Night_Sky_Black_Rock_Desert_Nevada.jpg/500px-Milky_Way_Night_Sky_Black_Rock_Desert_Nevada.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Milky_Way_Night_Sky_Black_Rock_Desert_Nevada.jpg/500px-Milky_Way_Night_Sky_Black_Rock_Desert_Nevada.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMilky_Way_Night_Sky_Black_Rock_Desert_Nevada.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a6/Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States_-_Roberts_Court_202